          "quote": "完整的实验室检查结果（血常规、凝血全套、肝肾功能、电解质）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 had a minor/moderate omission. The doctor actively pursued imaging, endoscopy, CBC, liver/kidney function, coagulation, medications, procedure notes, and used workspace records, but did not meaningfully ask for or integrate viral hepatitis/HBV-DNA testing status despite the case and visible record making it discoverable and relevant.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
